{%- comment -%}
  Stylesheet, fonts and script shared by every Advent section.
  On the advent-calendar product template this is rendered once in <head> (layout/theme.liquid),
  so the page is styled before it first paints. If an Advent section is added to any other
  template, the section renders this itself as a fallback.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
{{ 'advent-calendar.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag: preload: true }}
{%- comment -%}
  Headings (Cormorant Garamond, Pinyon Script) use display=block: they wait briefly for the real font
  instead of showing a different-looking fallback first, which caused a visible "flash" on first load.
  Body text (Jost) keeps display=swap so it shows straight away.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500;1,600&family=Pinyon+Script&display=block" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="{{ 'advent-calendar.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
